// Fixed guardrail replies. These never vary and are never generated by a model, so an
// applicant always sees the same, reviewed wording (translated on other-language pages).

/** Exact wording for requests outside the chatbot's purpose. Do not change without approval. */
export const OUT_OF_SCOPE_MESSAGE =
  "I'm here to help you with your Invest Detroit loan application. I can explain application questions, clarify financial terms, and guide you through the process, but I can't assist with unrelated requests. Is there anything about your application I can help you with?"

/** For application-related requests to leave out, change or make up information. */
export const INTEGRITY_MESSAGE =
  'Applications need to be accurate and truthful, so I can\'t help with leaving out, changing or making up information. When you submit, you confirm that your answers are truthful and accurate to the best of your knowledge. I can help you understand what a question is asking and how to report your figures correctly, for example which revenue number to use. What would you like to work through?'

/** For messages where the intent is unclear. */
export const CLARIFY_MESSAGE =
  'I want to make sure I help with the right thing. Is this about a question on your application, a document you need, or a financial term? Tell me a little more and I\'ll do my best to help.'

export const GUARDRAIL_VERSION = '1.0'
